<section class="hero">
  <h1>Verifiable Financial Documents</h1>
  <p>
  DOC.USD is a cryptographically verifiable document currency system that transforms invoices,
  receipts, and financial records into tamper-proof, independently verifiable instruments.
  </p>
  <button onclick="location.href='whitepaper.html'">Read Whitepaper</button>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>What This Solves</h2>
  <div class="card">
    Financial documents today are not verifiable. DOC.USD creates
    tamper-evident, hash-verifiable financial records that can be audited independently.
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>How It Works</h2>
  <div class="card">
    DOC.USD → INSTABYTE → INSTA-FICHE → IPFS → On-Chain Registry
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Live Public Registry</h2>
  <div class="card">
    The system includes a public content-addressed registry that maps document instruments
    to immutable IPFS CIDs and on-chain anchors.
  </div>
  <button onclick="location.href='registry.html'">View Registry</button>
</section>

